# Keep the release archive loadable for consumers: tests/ and tools/ load
# dev-only modules (rules_itest, rules_kind, rules_kafka, rules_helm,
# rules_shell), which a consumer can't see, so `bazel query @rules_mimir//...`
# would fail on them. GitHub's tag tarballs honour export-ignore. (A
# git_override clone still has them.)
tests/ export-ignore
tools/ export-ignore
